\title{Benjamin Bakker：Non-abelian Hodge Theory for Non-proper Varieties}
\date{2026-09-28}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Benjamin Bakker，Non-abelian Hodge Theory for Non-proper Varieties and the Linear Shafarevich Conjecture，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，卷 3，第 549 至 568 页。}
\p{[论文集全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1807381)；[作者讲稿](https://benjamin-bakker.github.io/ICM_2026.pdf)。主要研究结果来自 Bakker、Yohan Brunebarbe 与 Jacob Tsimerman 的 [The linear Shafarevich conjecture for quasiprojective varieties and algebraicity of Shafarevich morphisms](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.16441)。}
